<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<section class="hero compact"><p class="eyebrow">SHERUBTSE TRIPHUB · STUDENT INFORMATION</p><h1>About, help and safety</h1><p>Explore. Experience. Connect. Sherubtse TripHub is a proposed student-focused travel planning and management platform for Sherubtse College, Kanglung. This project does not represent official institutional endorsement.</p></section>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqs"><h2 id="faqs">Frequently asked questions</h2>
<% faqs.forEach(item=>{ %><details class="card" style="margin:0 0 12px;padding:16px"><summary><strong><%= item.question %></strong></summary><p><%= item.answer %></p></details><% }) %>
</section>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="rules"><h2 id="rules">Travel rules and safety guidelines</h2><div class="grid cards-grid"><% rules.forEach(r=>{ %><article class="card"><h3><%= r.title %></h3><p><%= r.body %></p></article><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="section"><h2>Emergency information</h2><p>Save your Trip Coordinator's contact information and verify emergency numbers before travel.</p><div class="grid cards-grid"><div class="card"><h3>Police</h3><p><strong>113</strong></p></div><div class="card"><h3>Ambulance</h3><p><strong>112</strong></p></div><div class="card"><h3>Fire and rescue</h3><p><strong>110</strong></p></div></div><p class="small-muted">These numbers were supplied in the reference material and should be checked with Bhutanese authorities before publication.</p></section>
<section class="section"><h2>Student experiences</h2><p class="small-muted">The following testimonials are fictional demonstration content, not real student endorsements.</p><div class="grid cards-grid"><% testimonials.forEach(t=>{ %><blockquote class="card"><strong><%= t.title %></strong><p>“<%= t.quote %>”</p><footer><%= t.attribution || 'Sample testimonial' %> · Sample</footer></blockquote><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="section"><h2>Photograph credits</h2><p>Destination photos supplied for project demonstration. Where a photographer credit was not included, ownership has not been verified.</p><ul><% photos.forEach(p=>{ %><li><%= p.name %> — <%= p.photo_credit || 'Credit not supplied; verify reuse permission' %></li><% }) %></ul></section>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
